[00:22.46]1. Loyal love! God is love.
[00:44.92]We can sense his care from above.
[00:54.04]God by means of his precious Son
[01:00.64]Paid the ransom for ev’ryone,
[01:07.64]Giving hope that we might possess
[01:14.64]Life eternal and happiness.
[01:18.26](Chorus)
[01:21.88]Hey there, all you thirsty ones,
[01:28.58]Come and drink life’s water free.
[01:35.80]Yes, come drink, you thirsty ones;
[01:42.08]God’s loyal love you’ll see.
[01:56.54]2. Loyal love! God is love.
[02:03.55]All his works give proof of his love.
[02:10.19]Love Jehovah has further shown,
[02:17.35]Giving Jesus the kingly throne.
[02:24.24]God’s own purpose has come to pass.
[02:31.14]See! His Kingdom is here at last!
[02:34.68](Chorus)
[02:38.22]Hey there, all you thirsty ones,
[02:45.21]Come and drink life’s water free.
[02:52.11]Yes, come drink, you thirsty ones;
[02:59.19]God’s loyal love you’ll see.
[03:09.60]3. Loyal love! God is love.
[03:16.10]May his spirit move us to love.
[03:23.42]As we loyally help the meek,
[03:29.82]God’s commandments they learn to keep.
[03:37.44]We are serving with godly fear,
[03:42.00]Preaching boldly for all to hear.
[03:46.56](Chorus)
[03:51.12]Hey there, all you thirsty ones,
[03:55.96]Come and drink life’s water free.
[04:02.96]Yes, come drink, you thirsty ones;
[04:17.28]God’s loyal love you’ll see.